<section id="criteria" class="criteria">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>What We Look For</h2>
    <p>
      We focus on B2B software companies that support mission-critical
      workflows in a specific industry.
    </p>
    <p>We gravitate toward:</p>
    <ul class="criteria-list">
      <li>Founder-led or founder-owned</li>
      <li>Profitable, with a real operating history</li>
      <li>Recurring revenue and strong retention</li>
      <li>A durable niche with clear reasons customers stay</li>
      <li>A team that wants to keep building</li>
      <li>EBITDA between $250K and $2M</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We especially like regulated, slower-moving industries where barriers to
      entry are high, switching costs are real, and customers value stability
      more than chasing the newest trend.
    </p>
    <p>
      If your company doesn't check every box, we'd rather have a conversation
      than miss a company that could&nbsp;be&nbsp;a&nbsp;great&nbsp;fit.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .criteria-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 1.25rem 0 1.5rem;
    max-width: 65ch;
  }

  .criteria-list li {
    padding: 0.7rem 0 0.7rem 1.75rem;
    position: relative;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .criteria-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .criteria-list li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 1.15rem;
    width: 10px;
    height: 10px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--ember);
  }
</style>
